{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1526974-mimicking-telepathy","id":1526974,"title":"Mimicking Telepathy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-12-17T03:17:20-08:00","id":1526974,"title":"Mimicking Telepathy","content":"I'm trying to create a Nova who thinks they are a Telepath.<br /> I know Novas can't have actual psychic powers or manipulate noetic powers, but the goal is not to be a real psion/psiad, just someone who appears to have Telepathic powers, to the point of genuinely thinking those powers are the real deal.<br /> <br /> So, to mimic Telepathy I'm thinking of those mega-edges and powers:<br /> -Detection (Thoughts) or Detection (Brainwaves) to know when thinking beings are near.<br /> -Revealing Read to figure out what those beings are thinking.<br /> -Telecommunication. For clear, two way mental communication with other Novas<br /> -Illusion: to whisper to the ear of a baseline without actually talking to them.<br /> <br /> Do you think that would work? Do you have other ideas?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-17T04:36:11-08:00","id":1526978,"title":"","content":"The \u201cauditive illusion\u201d is a nice addition to the idea. Really interesting! For sure it will work.<br /> <br /> You could add other Social Mega edges, like Hypnotic Presence for inserting ideas directly to the target mind, make everyone more su